    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on thompson1917-ch16-18: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.64";
    dc:description "Coordinated change is measurable, and multivariate public morphology is substantial. Existing observational data cannot cleanly attribute covariance to mechanical forces rather than development, selection or phylogeny.";
