    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Quantify whether ecological transitions and altered mechanical regimes are associated with coordinated, graded changes across multiple anatomical modules rather than isolated traits, using phylogenetic multivariate models.";
